Subject: [PATCH] Identify the Sairedis registry module by its exact source

Sairedis declares version 0.0.2 in its source tree. Use a new revision with the full
source commit so Bazel resolves this registration to the reviewed archive.
This registry-only patch changes the module version, not the build rules.

Source: https://github.com/securely1g/sonic-sairedis/commit/aba7b649177fbdc2a650807410443d6dd4cfa929

--- a/MODULE.bazel
+++ b/MODULE.bazel
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 # Keep bazel_compatibility in sync with sonic-buildimage's .bazelversion.
 module(
     name = "sonic-sairedis",
-    version = "0.0.2",
+    version = "0.0.3-aba7b649177fbdc2a650807410443d6dd4cfa929",
     bazel_compatibility = [
         ">=8.5.1",
         "<=8.5.1",
